<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Thursday 105,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Thursday 105,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Thursday's est receipts 105,000, Wk ago 100,000, Yr ago 104,000 head at interior Iowa/so Minnesota. Estimates include generally about 65 percent Carcass Base Hogs. Barrows and gilts traded $1.00 to $1.50 higher than mid-session Wednesday. Trade was slow to moderate for good demand and light to moderate offerings. Top $57.00 per cwt.</p>
